          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wukukuhwelela Mwana wukweti wumi wahaya nyaka; hakwila muntu wabulaŋa kwovwahila Mwana hakamona wumuku, kuzuwa kwaNzambi kwashakama hadi yena.",
          "type": "text",
